      'Institutionalize quality with a short style guide: claim rules, measurement formats, tone, and how variants are named. Consistency makes catalogs scannable and keeps freelancers from inventing dialects per collection.',
      'Use Interdot’s free SEO Meta Generator to accelerate first drafts or structured options, then human-edit. AI should never invent warranties, medical claims, or stock status. Publish only after ops confirms facts and a writer confirms voice.',
      'Differentiate channels carefully. Keep a canonical facts sheet, then adapt length and emphasis for your storefront, marketplaces, email, and ads. Facts stay identical; presentation changes. That single rule prevents chargebacks rooted in mismatched promises.',
      'Test on high-impact SKUs first. Change one major module when you can isolate effects, record the hypothesis, and review conversion plus “not as described” refunds after enough volume. Swipe-file winners so seasonal rushes do not reinvent weak copy.',
      'Avoid the failure modes that look like productivity: mass-pasting supplier text, stuffing titles, fabricating scarcity, guessing FAQs, and arguing with reviewers in public. Each shortcut creates support debt that costs more than slower careful writing.',
